            "key_investigations.1",
            "key_investigations.2",
            "key_investigations.3",
            "treatment.0",
            "treatment.1",
            "treatment.2",
            "treatment.3"
          ],
          "text": "On admission she was haemodynamically compromised (HR 104, BP 104/64) with an Hb of 78. She was transfused 2 units of red blood cells, with Hb rising to 92 by Day 2. OGD on Day 1 demonstrated a Forrest IIa duodenal ulcer; adrenaline injection and clipping were performed with successful haemostasis. She received an IV PPI infusion throughout. CLO test confirmed H. pylori infection. Apixaban (background AF) was withheld during the admission.",
          "unverified_fact_ids": []
        },
        {
